+/****************************************************************************
+ * WebRtcIsac_GetCrc(...)
+ *
+ * This function returns a 32 bit CRC checksum of a bit stream
+ *
+ * Input:
+ *  - encoded      : payload bit stream
+ *  - no_of_word8s : number of 8-bit words in the bit stream
